{'symbol': 'AKAM', 'date': '2021-06-15 06:30:00', 'title': 'AKAMAI BOOSTS EDGE APPLICATION POWER, EXPANDING POSSIBILITIES FOR DEVELOPERS', 'text': "CAMBRIDGE, MASS., JUNE 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 AKAMAI \xa0(NASDAQ: AKAM),\xa0THE WORLD'S MOST TRUSTED SOLUTION FOR PROTECTING AND DELIVERING DIGITAL EXPERIENCES,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCES POWERFUL ENHANCEMENTS DESIGNED TO ENABLE AKAMAI CUSTOMERS TO CREATE AND DELIVER EVEN MORE EXCEPTIONAL USER EXPERIENCES AT THE EDGE."}{'symbol': 'AMCR', 'date': '2021-06-15 12:18:00', 'title': 'AMCOR SEES U.S. PLASTICS PACT ROADMAP LAUNCH AS OPPORTUNITY TO DRIVE CIRCULAR ECONOMY PROGRESS', 'text': 'ZURICH--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #CIRCULARECONOMY--AMCOR IS PROUD TO SUPPORT THE U.S. PLASTICS PACT ROADMAP, THE FIRST NATIONAL PLAN TO ACHIEVE REUSABLE OR RECYCLABLE PLASTIC PACKAGING BY 2025.'}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2021-06-15 14:00:00', 'title': 'AWWA 2021 AMERICAN WATER SCHOLARSHIP PRESENTED TO UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO DOCTORAL STUDENT PARUL BARANWAL', 'text': 'CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PARUL BARANWAL, A DOCTORAL STUDENT AT THE UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO, HAS BEEN CHOSEN AS THE RECIPIENT OF THE AMERICAN WATER WORKS ASSOCIATION (AWWA) 2021 AMERICAN WATER SCHOLARSHIP. THE SCHOLARSHIP IS AN ANNUAL AWARD OF $5,000 PRESENTED TO A GRADUATE LEVEL STUDENT TO ASSIST WITH THE DEVELOPMENT OF PROFESSIONALS INTERESTED IN SERVICE TO THE WATER INDUS'}{'symbol': 'AMGN', 'date': '2021-06-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'ACCLAIMED MAKEUP ARTIST ALLAN AVENDAÑO OPENS UP ABOUT PERSONAL SKIN CONDITION: PROVIDES INSIDE LOOK AT LIFE WITH PLAQUE PSORIASIS', 'text': 'THOUSAND OAKS, CALIF., JUNE 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AMGEN (NASDAQ:AMGN) AND OTEZLA® (APREMILAST) HAVE PARTNERED WITH ALLAN AVENDAÑO, MAKEUP ARTIST TO HOLLYWOOD A-LISTERS, FOR THE INSIDE LOOK CAMPAIGN TO SHARE HIS JOURNEY LIVING WITH PLAQUE PSORIASIS AND THE DIFFICULTIES OF BEING IN HIS DEMANDING ROL