E 50 MG WAS -14.1 (0.51) COMPARED WITH -12.3 (0.50) FOR PATIENTS WHO RECEIVED PLACEBO (LS MEAN DIFFERENCE -1.7 POINTS; P=0.0141).'}{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2021-06-15 16:00:00', 'title': "BLACKROCK ENRICHES ALADDIN PLATFORM'S DERIVATIVES CAPABILITIES WITH CASSINI PARTNERSHIP", 'text': "NEW YORK, JUNE 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BLACKROCK (NYSE: BLK) AND CASSINI SYSTEMS, A LEADING PROVIDER OF PRE- AND POST-TRADE MARGIN AND COLLATERAL ANALYTICS FOR DERIVATIVES MARKETS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE TWO FIRMS HAVE ENTERED INTO A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP TO INTEGRATE CASSINI ANALYTICS INTO BLACKROCK'S ALADDIN® PLATFORM. THE INTEGRATION WILL ALLOW MUTUAL CLIENTS TO FACTOR MARGIN-BASED ANALYTICS INTO THEIR PRE- AND POST-TRADE DECISION-MAKING."}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2021-06-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER PUBLISHES 2021 SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, SHOWCASES SIGNIFICANT ACHIEVEMENTS AND HIGH-REACHING GOALS', 'text': 'AUBURN HILLS, MICH., JUNE 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER, A COMPANY FOCUSED ON DELIVERING INNOVATIVE AND SUSTAINABLE MOBILITY SOLUTIONS FOR THE VEHICLE MARKET, HAS RELEASED ITS 2021 SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, "EVOLVING FOR ALL," DETAILING THE COMPANY\'S RECENT SUSTAINABILITY ACCOMPLISHMENTS AND SHOWCASING SHORT- AND LONG-TERM GOALS FOR ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP, SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY AND GOVERNANCE.'}{'symbol': 'AVGO', 'date': '2021-06-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'BROADCOM DELIVERS INDUSTRY-FIRST VALUE STREAM MANAGEMENT SOLUTION THAT SEAMLESSLY COMBINES PLANNING AND AGILE MANAGEMENT CAPABILITIES', 'text': 'LEADING-EDGE SOFTWARE INTEGRATION IMPROVES ENTERPRISE ALIGNMENT AND EFFICIENCY LEADING-EDGE SOFTWARE INTEGRATION IMPROVES ENTERPRISE ALIGNMENT AND EFFICIENCY'}{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-06-15 11:00:00', 'title': '2021 WORLD SERIES OF POKER DAILY EVENT SCHEDULE FINALIZED', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, JUNE 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE WORLD SERIES OF POKER® (WSOP®) – THE RICHEST, MOST PRESTIGIOUS AND LONGEST-RUNNING POKER SERIES – HAS FINALIZED ITS DAILY EVENT SCHE